#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0230 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "TRTSEQAN, the operator's TARGET and the rule's single Requirements.Variables.All entry, is absent. Without it the absent target would take the EC-53 fast path (nameIdx < 0 -> empty BitSet) and the rule would be silently no-violation; with it the run reports an auditable skip naming TRTSEQAN. Not a template, so no wildcard rewrite is involved."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col TRTSEQA type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | A-B
S1 | 002 | A-B
S1 | 003 | B-A
